### Changed
- AboutScrollStack Component Complete Redesign (2025-09-07)
  - Replaced simple text rotation with interactive 4-step process cards
  - Added "How Mononio AI Works" section with Connect, Analyze, Optimize, Scale steps
  - Implemented ScrollStack integration with custom styling and animations
  - Added gradient backgrounds and animated indicators for each step
- AboutSection Content and Messaging Overhaul (2025-09-07)
  - Updated main title from "Mononio AI: Our Guiding Principles" to "Our Story. Our Promise"
  - Enhanced subtitle with more compelling marketing copy
  - Updated call-to-action from "Experience the Power of Our Principles" to "Ready For Your Own Marketing Seal Team"
  - Changed button text to "Start Your Journey Now"
- ScrollStack Component Major Enhancement (2025-09-07)
  - Added "use client" directive for proper client-side rendering
  - Implemented scroll chaining functionality with enableScrollChaining prop
  - Enhanced performance with transform caching and optimization
  - Added wheel event handling for better scroll experience
  - Improved z-index management and stacking behavior
  - Added backface visibility and perspective optimizations
- LogoCloud Component Responsive Design Overhaul (2025-01-27)
  - Implemented mobile-first responsive design with breakpoint-specific heights
  - Updated padding system from `py-12 sm:py-16` to `py-8 md:py-10 lg:py-12 xl:py-16`
  - Added conditional logo rendering for mobile devices (hides logos beyond index 5)
  - Optimized YouTube logo width from 160px to 140px for better visual balance
  - Complete CSS rewrite with responsive viewport and logo sizing system
- ScrollStack Component Browser Compatibility Enhancement (2025-01-27)
  - Integrated browser-specific configuration system using `browserCompat.ts`
  - Added new props: `style` and `enableScrollChaining` for enhanced control
  - Implemented transform caching and boundary limiting for performance optimization
  - Added scroll chaining functionality with wheel event handling
  - Enhanced container height management with browser-specific configurations
  - Improved hardware acceleration controls based on browser capabilities
- Navbar Navigation Update (2025-09-07)
  - Changed "Our Vision" link to "Our Story" for better alignment with AboutSection
- Navbar Navigation Link Update (2025-01-27)
  - Changed "Our Vision" link to "Our Story" for better alignment with AboutSection content
- Main Page Structure Enhancement (2025-09-07)
  - Added AboutScrollStack component integration between AboutSection and Platform Section
  - Improved content flow and user experience
- LogoCloud Mononio Logo Integration
- Logo file organization and path updates
- Development Server Status Verification
- MagicBento Component Manual Enhancements
- Template System Enhancement
- LogoCloud CSS Layout Optimization
- LogoCloud Logo Size Hierarchy Implementation
- LogoCloud Maximum Height Constraint Update
- Outbrain Logo Size Reduction
- Main Page Platform Section Enhancement
- Performance Monitoring Script Implementation
- Development Server Stability Improvements
- Project Structure Documentation
- Navbar Navigation Structure Update with Hebrew Localization

### Fixed
- AboutScrollStack TypeScript Error Resolution (2025-09-07)
  - Removed invalid style prop from ScrollStackItem component
